  "explanation": "The question asks what position Merit Janow currently or formerly holds. From the provided documents, two distinct and complementary positions are supported:\n\n1. **Dean**: Document d1 (D1S3) explicitly states that Merit Janow is a 'distinguished American academic who has earned the esteemed title of dean.' Additional supporting evidence includes her leadership roles, administrative acumen, and the official confirmation of her deanship in D1S22.\n\n2. **Member of the Swedish Riksdag**: Document d2 (D2S17) directly states that Merit Janow 'holds a position as a member of the Swedish Riksdag.' Further contextual support is found in D2S5, which describes her political involvement and advocacy in Sweden.\n\nBoth positions are independently supported by their respective documents and do not contradict each other. They represent distinct aspects of Merit Janow’s professional life—academic leadership and political service—and should be preserved as separate valid answers."
